<title>HONG KONG: Moody's rates Shenzhen Int'l Trust debt Ba1.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates Shenzhen Int'l Trust debt Ba1.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service said on Friday it assigned a Ba1 rating to the long-term foreign currency debt of Shenzhen International Trust &amp; Investment Corporation (SITIC), a commercial unit of China's Shenzhen municipal government.</p>
</text>
